  "consolidationFidelityNote": "RESOLVED 2026-09-04. C21 is complete across all thirteen families: 330 exact, 0 drift, 0 absent, run with the package's own c21-fidelity-reconciliation.py \u2014 the same instrument that produced the earlier 255/255 result, so the figures are directly comparable. The DATA (20), API (25), SEC (30) and non-pilot CODE (12) recaps were located in ProjectOne-Supplemental-Context-Package-v1.0.zip and verified byte-identical to the transfer manifest recorded on 2026-08-13. The check was negative-tested before the result was relied on: three deliberate defects (a sentence inserted into SEC-21, a word swapped in DATA-15, an API heading removed) were all detected in the correct families. Prior text, retained as history: \"75 of 330 requirements have untested consolidation fidelity pending DATA/API/SEC and non-pilot CODE recap docs \u2014 a branch-local pause the owner ratified.\""
